        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIR ABANDON – A DEEP ROGUE-LITE RPG EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;In this unforgiving world, giving up will be your only victory.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into the universe of <strong>SIR ABANDON</strong>, a tactical and demanding rogue-lite that fuses action-platforming, deep RPG mechanics, and epic quests within a dark world teeming with secrets and challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ EXPLORE, QUEST, AND SURVIVE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Runs:</strong> Explore areas packed with traps, hidden treasures, and secret passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Interconnected World:</strong> Complete main and side quests that shape your journey and boost your progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Achievements:</strong> Unlock achievements to earn powerful, permanent rewards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛡️ CLASS SYSTEM &amp; RPG PROGRESSION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Your Playstyle:</strong> Choose from multiple playable characters and classes, each featuring their own combat style and unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow More Powerful:</strong> Gain experience, level up, and allocate talent points into a comprehensive skill tree to customize your hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear Up:</strong> Equip rare weapons and armor tailored to your playstyle to survive the threats ahead.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔨 LOOT, CRAFT &amp; ECONOMY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Thrill of the Farm:</strong> Defeat formidable enemies to loot valuable components and resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading:</strong> Sell your surplus to merchants to buy higher-quality equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Forge:</strong> Craft your own weapons and armor by combining rare materials found throughout your runs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 RICH AND TACTICAL GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Methodical Combat:</strong> A rigorous combat system that requires careful reading of enemy patterns, strategic thinking, and precise encounter management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Bosses:</strong> Defeat fearsome bosses that will put your strategy and mastery of the game mechanics to the ultimate test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong> Lose yourself in a beautifully crafted art style accompanied by an epic soundtrack.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHY TAKE ON THE CHALLENGE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love <strong>challenging rogue-lites</strong> where exploration, crafting, deep customization, and RPG progression are at the heart of the gameplay, then <strong>SIR ABANDON</strong> is made for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to learn from your failures, hone your strategy, and uncover the mysteries of a fascinating world!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIR ABANDON – A DEEP ROGUE-LITE RPG EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;In this unforgiving world, giving up will be your only victory.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into the universe of <strong>SIR ABANDON</strong>, a tactical and demanding rogue-lite that fuses action-platforming, deep RPG mechanics, and epic quests within a dark world teeming with secrets and challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ EXPLORE, QUEST, AND SURVIVE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Runs:</strong> Explore areas packed with traps, hidden treasures, and secret passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Interconnected World:</strong> Complete main and side quests that shape your journey and boost your progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Achievements:</strong> Unlock achievements to earn powerful, permanent rewards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛡️ CLASS SYSTEM &amp; RPG PROGRESSION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Your Playstyle:</strong> Choose from multiple playable characters and classes, each featuring their own combat style and unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow More Powerful:</strong> Gain experience, level up, and allocate talent points into a comprehensive skill tree to customize your hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear Up:</strong> Equip rare weapons and armor tailored to your playstyle to survive the threats ahead.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔨 LOOT, CRAFT &amp; ECONOMY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Thrill of the Farm:</strong> Defeat formidable enemies to loot valuable components and resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading:</strong> Sell your surplus to merchants to buy higher-quality equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Forge:</strong> Craft your own weapons and armor by combining rare materials found throughout your runs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 RICH AND TACTICAL GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Methodical Combat:</strong> A rigorous combat system that requires careful reading of enemy patterns, strategic thinking, and precise encounter management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Bosses:</strong> Defeat fearsome bosses that will put your strategy and mastery of the game mechanics to the ultimate test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong> Lose yourself in a beautifully crafted art style accompanied by an epic soundtrack.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHY TAKE ON THE CHALLENGE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love <strong>challenging rogue-lites</strong> where exploration, crafting, deep customization, and RPG progression are at the heart of the gameplay, then <strong>SIR ABANDON</strong> is made for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to learn from your failures, hone your strategy, and uncover the mysteries of a fascinating world!</p>",
        "short_description": "SIR ABANDON is an open-world Metroidvania RPG blending exploration, dynamic combat, and character progression. Complete quests, battle epic bosses, find hidden treasures, and upgrade your hero with a class system, gear, and talents.",
